    <briefdescription>
<para>Constant local volatility, no time-strike dependence. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the LocalVolatilityTermStructure interface for a constant local volatility (no time/asset dependence). Local volatility and Black volatility are the same when volatility is at most time dependent, so this class is basically a proxy for BlackVolatilityTermStructure. </para>    </detaileddescription>
